# Allow-list: the image is built from the workspace manifests and sources only. Anything else
# (local data with personal documents, browser caches, agent worktrees) never enters the context.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!frontend/
!backend/
!shared/

# Never needed inside the allowed folders
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.sqlite
backend/prisma/generated
frontend/src/__tests__
backend/src/__tests__
